       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
      * CHANGED SOURCE 10/15/03 8:10 AM
      * FARMED FROM GARYM 01/28/10
      * ADD TO LMI AS TYPE *PGM, ATTR SQLCBL
      *     CREATES A *PGM CBL
       PROGRAM-ID.  COMMTST.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WORK-DATE-TIME.
           05  WORK-DATE-TIME-STAMP     PIC  X(26).
           EXEC SQL
             INCLUDE SQLCA
           END-EXEC.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  PARM1               PIC      X(10).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING PARM1.
       PARA-1.
           MOVE SPACES TO PARM1.
           EXEC SQL
             SELECT CURRNT TIMESTAMP
             INTO :WORK-DATE-TIME-STAMP
             FROM ONEROWTBL
           END-EXEC.
           STOP RUN.
